  "name": "Domestic Abuse Act 2021 Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Domestic Abuse Act 2021 Committee was appointed to consider the Domestic Abuse Act 2021.</p>\r\n<p>Please note that the Committee is unable to consider or assist with individual cases. If you are in immediate danger,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.police.uk/pu/contact-us/\">contact the police</a>.</p>\r\n<p>If you or someone you know is a victim of domestic abuse, the Government has published&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/coronavirus-covid-19-and-domestic-abuse/coronavirus-covid-19-support-for-victims-of-domestic-abuse\">information about helplines&nbsp;and websites</a>&nbsp;that may be able to help.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the committee on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/domestic-abuse-act-2021-committee/\">LinkedIn</a></p>",
